      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ONE FEATHER (2) was in traffic and fell last start but the start prior was a Grade 5/6 winner in the quickest time on the card at this track in a Grade 5/6. With a good start should be able to take advantage of the low draw. No luck latest and can atone. ASTON SUSHI (3) has shown good speed at her last couple and filled minor placings, last time finishing third beaten 3.5 lengths (35.48). Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to her name from five starts. Well placed and gets her chance. LOOSE MOOSE (7) has been mixing form lately, hitting the frame two back before finishing fourth (34.94) at Angle Park in a Grade 6/MDN. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Well placed here and can atone this time. JUST JOHNNIE (6) missed the placings here most recently but can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
